{"brief": "B4", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "i": 1, "finish": "stop", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Vellum Hill Press \u00b7 Poetry, printed slowly</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Vellum Hill Press publishes small runs of contemporary poetry, hand-finished and made to be reread.\">\n<style>\n  /* ---------- Tokens ---------- */\n  :root {\n    --paper: #f6f2ea;\n    --paper-deep: #ebe4d6;\n    --ink: #1f1c17;\n    --ink-soft: #5b5448;\n    --rule: #d6cdbb;\n    --oxblood: #7a2e2b;\n    --oxblood-dark: #5c211f;\n    --sage: #6d7c66;\n    --ochre: #b98a3e;\n    --night: #1b2328;\n\n    --serif: \"Iowan Old Style\", \"Palatino Linotype\", Palatino, \"Book Antiqua\", Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n\n    --measure: 66ch;\n    --wrap: 1140px;\n    --radius: 3px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Base ---------- */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 0.98rem + 0.3vw, 1.2rem);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n  a { color: var(--oxblood); text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }\n  a:hover { color: var(--oxblood-dark); }\n  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 0.5em; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1em; }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--oxblood); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 2px; }\n\n  .wrap { width: min(100% - 2.5rem, var(--wrap)); margin-inline: auto; }\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    margin: 0 0 1rem;\n  }\n  .skip {\n    position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: 0;\n    background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: .5rem 1rem; z-index: 100;\n  }\n  .skip:focus { left: 1rem; top: 1rem; }\n\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.92rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: transparent;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s;\n  }\n  .btn:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }\n  .btn--solid { background: var(--oxblood); border-color: var(--oxblood); color: var(--paper); }\n  .btn--solid:hover { background: var(--oxblood-dark); border-color: var(--oxblood-dark); color: var(--paper); }\n  .link-arrow {\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.92rem; text-decoration: none;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .site-header {\n    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;\n    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 92%, transparent);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .site-header .wrap {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem; padding-block: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); }\n  .brand-mark { width: 30px; height: 30px; flex: none; }\n  .brand-name { font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }\n  .brand-name em { font-style: italic; color: var(--oxblood); }\n  .nav { display: flex; gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem); flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .nav a {\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink);\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  .nav a:hover { color: var(--oxblood); }\n  .nav a[aria-current=\"page\"] { color: var(--oxblood); }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); }\n  .hero-grid {\n    display: grid; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);\n    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 1.6rem + 4.2vw, 4.9rem);\n    line-height: 1.02;\n    margin-bottom: .4em;\n  }\n  .hero h1 em { color: var(--oxblood); }\n  .lede { font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1rem + 0.5vw, 1.35rem); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 36ch; margin-bottom: 2rem; }\n  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: .9rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }\n  .hero-meta {\n    margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft);\n    display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- CSS-only book covers (no external images) ---------- */\n  .cover {\n    position: relative;\n    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 320px;\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding: 1.4rem 1.3rem 1.2rem;\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;\n    color: var(--paper);\n    background: var(--c, var(--oxblood));\n    border-radius: 2px 6px 6px 2px;\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 10px 0 0 -6px rgba(0,0,0,.25),\n      0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.05),\n      0 18px 30px -18px rgba(31,28,23,.55),\n      0 4px 8px -4px rgba(31,28,23,.25);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .cover::before {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 0;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(120% 60% at 100% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 60%),\n      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.18));\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .cover::after {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 14px; width: 1px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.22);\n  }\n  .cover .c-series {\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .62rem; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .85;\n  }\n  .cover .c-title {\n    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 1.2rem + 1.2vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0;\n  }\n  .cover .c-title em { font-style: italic; }\n  .cover .c-author {\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); padding-top: .75rem; margin: 0;\n  }\n  .cover .c-glyph {\n    position: absolute; right: 1rem; top: 40%;\n    width: 46px; height: 46px; opacity: .3;\n  }\n\n  .stack { position: relative; padding: 1rem 0 0; }\n  .stack .cover--back {\n    position: absolute; width: 78%; top: 2.5rem; right: -2rem; transform: rotate(6deg);\n    opacity: .9; z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .stack .cover--front { position: relative; z-index: 1; transform: rotate(-2deg); }\n\n  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */\n  section { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); }\n  .section-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }\n  .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.2vw, 3rem); margin: 0; }\n  .rule { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); margin: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Spring list ---------- */\n  .books {\n    list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;\n    display: grid; gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));\n  }\n  .book { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .book .cover { max-width: 100%; margin-inline: 0; }\n  .book-body { padding-top: 1.1rem; }\n  .book-body h3 { font-size: 1.45rem; margin-bottom: .15rem; }\n  .book-body h3 a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }\n  .book-body h3 a:hover { color: var(--oxblood); }\n  .book-by { font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: .75rem; }\n  .book-blurb { font-size: .98rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n  .book-foot {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft);\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: .75rem; margin-top: auto;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; padding: .25rem .55rem; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 99px;\n    margin-bottom: .5rem; color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Poem band ---------- */\n  .band {\n    background: var(--night); color: #ece6d8;\n    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);\n    position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .band::before {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n    background: radial-gradient(60% 80% at 85% 20%, rgba(185,138,62,.18), transparent 70%);\n  }\n  .band .eyebrow { color: #a9b3b6; }\n  .poem {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 auto; max-width: 34rem;\n    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.05rem + .8vw, 1.6rem);\n    line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .poem p { margin: 0 0 1.1em; }\n  .poem-cite {\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-style: normal; font-size: .85rem; letter-spacing: .06em;\n    color: #a9b3b6; margin-top: 2rem; display: block;\n  }\n  .poem-cite a { color: var(--ochre); }\n\n  /* ---------- About ---------- */\n  .about-grid { display: grid; gap: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; align-items: start; }\n  .about-grid h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.2vw, 3rem); }\n  .about-grid .lead { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); }\n  .about-grid p { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: var(--measure); }\n  .facts {\n    margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\n  }\n  .facts div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n  .facts dt { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .facts dd { margin: 0; font-size: 1.3rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- Submissions ---------- */\n  .subs {\n    background: var(--paper-deep);\n    border-block: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .subs-grid { display: grid; gap: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: start; }\n  .status {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .88rem; padding: .45rem .9rem;\n    background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 99px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .status::before {\n    content: \"\"; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sage);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 20%, transparent);\n  }\n  .guidelines { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\n  .guidelines li {\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr; gap: 1rem;\n    padding: .9rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .guidelines strong { font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--ink); }\n  .guidelines span { color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  /* ---------- Newsletter ---------- */\n  .newsletter { text-align: center; }\n  .newsletter h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 2.8rem); }\n  .newsletter p.sub { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 40ch; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }\n  form.signup {\n    display: flex; gap: .6rem; max-width: 30rem; margin: 0 auto; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;\n  }\n  form.signup label { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }\n  form.signup input {\n    flex: 1 1 16rem; font: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: .8rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius);\n    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  form.signup input::placeholder { color: #958c7b; }\n  .fine { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .8rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 1rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .site-footer { padding-block: 3rem 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .9rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .footer-grid { display: grid; gap: 2rem; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; }\n  .footer-grid h3 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }\n  .footer-grid ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .5rem; }\n  .footer-grid a { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; }\n  .footer-grid a:hover { color: var(--oxblood); }\n  .colophon {\n    margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: .82rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .hero-grid, .about-grid, .subs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .stack { max-width: 360px; }\n    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 560px) {\n    .guidelines li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .25rem; }\n    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .nav { gap: 1rem; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n    * { transition: none !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n<!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Vellum Hill Press, home\">\n      <svg class=\"brand-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7a2e2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <path d=\"M8 22 L16 8 L24 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1f1c17\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#7a2e2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"brand-name\">Vellum <em>Hill</em> Press</span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n      <a href=\"#books\" aria-current=\"page\">Books</a>\n      <a href=\"#authors\">Authors</a>\n      <a href=\"#about\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"#submit\">Submissions</a>\n      <a href=\"#newsletter\">Newsletter</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n\n<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->\n<div id=\"top\"></div>\n<section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Poetry &middot; Small runs &middot; Est. 2011</p>\n      <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Poems built to be read <em>twice.</em></h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Vellum Hill publishes four to six collections a year: hand-set, letterpressed where we can manage it, and printed in runs small enough that every copy gets looked at.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn--solid\" href=\"#books\">Browse the spring list</a>\n        <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"#sample\">Read a sample poem &rarr;</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n        <span>Spring 2025 &middot; Four new titles</span>\n        <span>Ships worldwide</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\" aria-label=\"Featured new collections\">\n      <div class=\"cover cover--back\" style=\"--c: var(--sage);\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span class=\"c-series\">Vellum Hill &middot; No. 14</span>\n        <p class=\"c-title\">The <em>Salt</em> Almanac</p>\n        <p class=\"c-author\">Ines Okafor-Reyes</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cover cover--front\" style=\"--c: var(--oxblood);\">\n        <span class=\"c-series\">Vellum Hill &middot; No. 15</span>\n        <svg class=\"c-glyph\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <p class=\"c-title\">Notes for a <em>Late</em> Orchard</p>\n        <p class=\"c-author\">Tomasz Wren</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<hr class=\"rule\" />\n\n<!-- ============ SPRING LIST ============ -->\n<section id=\"books\" aria-labelledby=\"books-title\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Spring 2025</p>\n        <h2 id=\"books-title\">The list</h2>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"#\">Full catalogue &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <ul class=\"books\">\n      <li class=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"cover\" style=\"--c: var(--night);\">\n          <span class=\"c-series\">Vellum Hill &middot; No. 13</span>\n          <p class=\"c-title\">Tidewater <em>Grammar</em></p>\n          <p class=\"c-author\">Adaeze Lindqvist</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"book-body\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">New &middot; Sold 80%</span>\n          <h3><a href=\"#\">Tidewater Grammar</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"book-by\">Adaeze Lindqvist</p>\n          <p class=\"book-blurb\">Forty-one poems in the grammar of coastlines, tides, and the long conjugations of leaving.</p>\n          <div class=\"book-foot\"><span>Paperback &middot; 72 pp.</span><span>$18</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"cover\" style=\"--c: var(--sage);\">\n          <span class=\"c-series\">Vellum Hill &middot; No. 14</span>\n          <p class=\"c-title\">The <em>Salt</em> Almanac</p>\n          <p class=\"c-author\">Ines Okafor-Reyes</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"book-body\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Limited &middot; 300 copies</span>\n          <h3><a href=\"#\">The Salt Almanac</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"book-by\">Ines Okafor-Reyes</p>\n          <p class=\"book-blurb\">A year of monthly poems, each keyed to a tide table, a recipe, or a weather report left unanswered.</p>\n          <div class=\"book-foot\"><span>Letterpress &middot; 56 pp.</span><span>$26</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"cover\" style=\"--c: var(--ochre); color: var(--ink);\">\n          <span class=\"c-series\">Vellum Hill &middot; No. 15</span>\n          <p class=\"c-title\">Notes for a <em>Late</em> Orchard</p>\n          <p class=\"c-author\">Tomasz Wren</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"book-body\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Forthcoming &middot; May</span>\n          <h3><a href=\"#\">Notes for a Late Orchard</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"book-by\">Tomasz Wren</p>\n          <p class=\"book-blurb\">Pruning, grafting, and the slow arithmetic of inheritance, set in a family\u2019s unfinished grove.</p>\n          <div class=\"book-foot\"><span>Paperback &middot; 88 pp.</span><span>$20</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ POEM BAND ============ -->\n<section class=\"band\" id=\"sample\" aria-labelledby=\"sample-title\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"sample-title\">From the current list</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"poem\">\n      <p>The orchard keeps its own accounts<br>\n      in windfalls, in the wasp\u2019s slow rent,<br>\n      and every branch we failed to prune<br>\n      is a sentence we were too tired to finish.</p>\n      <p>So we leave the ladder leaning in the grass.<br>\n      We let the frost decide what counts.<br>\n      Some years the fruit comes late, and small,<br>\n      and sweeter for having been waited for.</p>\n      <cite class=\"poem-cite\">Tomasz Wren, \u201cLedger,\u201d from <a href=\"#\">Notes for a Late Orchard</a></cite>\n    </blockquote>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->\n<section id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\">\n  <div class=\"wrap about-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">About the press</p>\n      <h2 id=\"about-title\">Two editors, one tiny press, a stubborn belief in the line break.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Vellum Hill began in a rented garage with a secondhand Heidelberg and an argument about margins. We still argue about margins.</p>\n      <p>We publish contemporary poetry by writers at every stage, from first collections to fifth. Our editorial process is slow on purpose: each manuscript gets at least three full readings, a proof read aloud, and a conversation with the author about every line that could go either way.</p>\n      <p>We print in runs of 300 to 800, bind by hand where the book calls for it, and keep the catalogue short enough that you can still find everything we\u2019ve made on one shelf.</p>\n    </div>\n    <dl class=\"facts\">\n      <div><dt>Titles in print</dt><dd>62</dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Years publishing</dt><dd>14</dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Books per year</dt><dd>4 to 6</dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Copies printed, lifetime</dt><dd>41,000</dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Poets published</dt><dd>48</dd></div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ SUBMISSIONS ============ -->\n<section class=\"subs\" id=\"submit\" aria-labelledby=\"submit-title\">\n  <div class=\"wrap subs-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Submissions</p>\n      <h2 id=\"submit-title\" style=\"font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.2vw, 3rem);\">Send us your manuscript.</h2>\n      <span class=\"status\">Open reading period: until 31 March</span>\n      <p>We read full-length manuscripts of 48 to 100 pages, and chapbooks of 20 to 30 pages in our Hillock series. Every submission receives a personal response, even when the answer is no.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Read full guidelines</a>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"guidelines\">\n      <li><strong>Full-length</strong><span>48\u2013100 pages, one manuscript per author per year.</span></li>\n      <li><strong>Chapbook</strong><span>20\u201330 pages, Hillock series, rolling reading.</span></li>\n      <li><strong>Fee</strong><span>$20, waived for applicants who request it.</span></li>\n      <li><strong>Format</strong><span>Single PDF, title page separate, author name omitted from the manuscript.</span></li>\n      <li><strong>Response</strong><span>Within four months. Shortlists announced in June.</span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ NEWSLETTER ============ -->\n<section class=\"newsletter\" id=\"newsletter\" aria-labelledby=\"news-title\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Newsletter</p>\n    <h2 id=\"news-title\">One letter a season. No more.</h2>\n    <p class=\"sub\">New titles, a poem from the archive, and first notice of readings and small-run releases.</p>\n    <form class=\"signup\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n      <label for=\"email\">Email address</label>\n      <input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn--solid\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button>\n    </form>\n    <p class=\"fine\">Four letters a year. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p style=\"font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: .5rem;\">Vellum <em>Hill</em> Press</p>\n        <p>41 Foundry Lane, Unit 3<br>Lowell Mill District<br>poetry@vellumhill.example</p>\n      </div>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Footer\">\n        <h3>Press</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#books\">Books</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#authors\">Authors</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#about\">About</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#submit\">Submissions</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Orders\">\n        <h3>Orders</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Shipping</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Bookshops</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Gift cards</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Returns</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Social\">\n        <h3>Elsewhere</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Instagram</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Mastodon</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Readings calendar</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"colophon\">\n      <span>&copy; 2025 Vellum Hill Press. All rights reserved by the authors.</span>\n      <span>Set in Iowan Old Style. Printed on uncoated 90gsm.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}